WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.057
- We're so caught up in the outcome

00:00:03.057 --> 00:00:06.037
that we forget about the process.

00:00:06.037 --> 00:00:07.287
To live better,

00:00:08.299 --> 00:00:11.183
we have to tune into the process.

00:00:11.183 --> 00:00:14.554
We have to tap into the present
moment to let go of fear.

00:00:14.554 --> 00:00:16.815
Because the power is in the now.

00:00:16.815 --> 00:00:19.133
A lot of us, we just want this lifestyle.

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:21.508
But we don't want to put in the work.

00:00:21.508 --> 00:00:23.577
We don't want to pay our dues.

00:00:23.577 --> 00:00:24.937
We don't want to be patient.

00:00:24.937 --> 00:00:26.930
- What's up, Believe Nation, it's Evan,

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:28.884
my one word is believe and I believe

00:00:28.884 --> 00:00:31.527
that you have the ability
to do something special

00:00:31.527 --> 00:00:33.002
that can change the planet.

00:00:33.002 --> 00:00:34.286
So to help you on your journey,

00:00:34.286 --> 00:00:36.182
