10 rules of success.

00:00:40.633 --> 00:00:41.863
(softly swishes)

00:00:41.863 --> 00:00:43.879
(softly thuds)

00:00:43.879 --> 00:00:47.212
(dramatic bright music)

00:00:53.879 --> 00:00:55.430
- Create value.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:59.262
So long as you are creating
value for the world,

00:00:59.262 --> 00:01:01.407
you have nothing to worry about.

00:01:01.407 --> 00:01:04.262
You will be living in infinite abundance.

00:01:04.262 --> 00:01:07.419
It's happened to me along my journey.

00:01:07.419 --> 00:01:10.426
Because it all starts with the idea.

00:01:10.426 --> 00:01:14.123
People like Steve Jobs, they
have this idea for Apple.

00:01:14.123 --> 00:01:17.035
Right, that idea is so powerful

00:01:17.035 --> 00:01:21.595
because it impacted people
all around the world,

00:01:21.595 --> 00:01:23.127
billions of people.

00:01:23.127 --> 00:01:24.544
So, create value.

00:01:25.924 --> 00:01:30.091
There was a time where I
used to reach into my pockets

00:01:31.594 --> 00:01:33.011
and it was empty.

00:01:34.487 --> 00:01:35.904
Then I got a job,

00:01:37.131 --> 00:01:40.176
and I would reach into my pockets,

00:01:40.176 --> 00:01:42.954
and guess what, it was empty.

00:01:42.954 --> 00:01:46.192
Then I started to do what I love,

00:01:46.192 --> 00:01:47.609
and, a big smile.

00:01:49.448 --> 00:01:51.709
I'm breathing in that fresh prana, baby.

00:01:51.709 --> 00:01:55.866
So, I'm balancing my mind
which gives me clarity

00:01:55.866 --> 00:01:59.283
which helps me become a better attractor.

00:02:00.368 --> 00:02:04.046
Okay, because there are many celebrities

00:02:04.046 --> 00:02:06.938
with so called a lot of money.

00:02:06.938 --> 00:02:08.643
I think Kanye West once said,

00:02:08.643 --> 00:02:13.222
"I sold my soul to the
devil for a crappy deal.

00:02:13.222 --> 00:02:16.889
"All I got was a few
toys and a happy meal."

00:02:18.049 --> 00:02:19.505
You've got to listen.

00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:22.130
Bob Dylan also tried to tell people.

00:02:22.130 --> 00:02:26.938
You see because it's not about
what looks good on paper,

00:02:26.938 --> 00:02:29.271
it's what looks good to you.

00:02:31.785 --> 00:02:34.368
Now, freedom is very important.

00:02:36.382 --> 00:02:39.351
You see, when you are growing up,

00:02:39.351 --> 00:02:41.114
when you are a child, when they say,

00:02:41.114 --> 00:02:43.451
"What do you want to be when you grow up?"

00:02:43.451 --> 00:02:46.229
What do you want to be when you grow up?

00:02:46.229 --> 00:02:50.635
Many of us, we don't say,
"I want to become rich."

00:02:50.635 --> 00:02:54.468
We say, "I want to do what
the hell I want to do."

00:02:55.801 --> 00:02:56.801
So, freedom,

00:02:57.772 --> 00:03:01.470
that's what we think money is, okay?

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:03.424
Once you have a lot of money, guess what,

00:03:03.424 --> 00:03:05.301
you can do whatever you want to do.

00:03:05.301 --> 00:03:07.638
So, you have to ask yourself,

00:03:07.638 --> 00:03:10.109
"Is money preventing me from doing

00:03:10.109 --> 00:03:12.359
"what I really want to do?"

00:03:14.266 --> 00:03:17.099
"Is money preventing me from doing

00:03:18.155 --> 00:03:20.569
"what I really want to do?"

00:03:20.569 --> 00:03:23.327
And then you've got to ask yourself,

00:03:23.327 --> 00:03:27.312
"What are my core needs, my core desires,

00:03:27.312 --> 00:03:31.411
"and how am I meeting
and fulfilling them?"

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:35.319
For me, my core need is
to get out into nature,

00:03:35.319 --> 00:03:40.185
and that's what makes me feel
like a walking billionaire.

00:03:40.185 --> 00:03:41.775
And guess what, I am.

00:03:41.775 --> 00:03:43.518
I am wealth.

00:03:43.518 --> 00:03:46.871
The good life, everyone
wants the good life.

00:03:46.871 --> 00:03:50.951
For some people, it may
be relaxing on a beach,

00:03:50.951 --> 00:03:54.591
for some people, it may be traveling.

00:03:54.591 --> 00:03:56.008
Infinite freedom.

00:03:57.311 --> 00:04:00.894
People spend thousands
of pounds or dollars

00:04:01.794 --> 00:04:05.951
to go to university to study to get a job.

00:04:05.951 --> 00:04:09.451
So all of us, so many of us on the planet,

00:04:10.855 --> 00:04:13.938
we are always striving for something.

00:04:15.012 --> 00:04:17.943
We're striving for the better life.

00:04:17.943 --> 00:04:19.629
What's helped me on my journey

00:04:19.629 --> 00:04:21.379
is to see the secret.

00:04:22.502 --> 00:04:23.419
Many of us,

00:04:25.855 --> 00:04:28.728
we're so caught up in the outcome

00:04:28.728 --> 00:04:31.602
that we forget about the process.

00:04:31.602 --> 00:04:35.685
To live better, we have
to tune into the process,

00:04:36.659 --> 00:04:39.188
which is the present moment.

00:04:39.188 --> 00:04:42.688
Many of us, we're working day in, day out.

00:04:45.739 --> 00:04:50.088
But in the process, we
are killing ourselves

00:04:50.088 --> 00:04:52.731
and by the time we have what we want,

00:04:52.731 --> 00:04:55.126
it doesn't even matter anymore.

00:04:55.126 --> 00:04:59.043
So, on my journey, I say,
"I am already there."

00:05:02.199 --> 00:05:05.781
It's fantastic, I don't
say, "I want happiness."

00:05:05.781 --> 00:05:08.233
I remove the I, which is ego,

00:05:08.233 --> 00:05:10.493
the want, which is the desire.

00:05:10.493 --> 00:05:12.076
I say, "Happiness."

00:05:12.926 --> 00:05:14.401
Stop multitasking.

00:05:14.401 --> 00:05:17.601
Like, I used to do so
many different things.

00:05:17.601 --> 00:05:19.459
I used to actually work in different jobs.

00:05:19.459 --> 00:05:21.087
Like, do this, do that.

00:05:21.087 --> 00:05:23.060
See, the problem with multitasking,

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:24.382
some people can do it.

00:05:24.382 --> 00:05:26.489
But the problem is, like
whatever you're doing,

00:05:26.489 --> 00:05:28.980
those different things,
they're going to suffer.

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:32.945
You're going to do lots of
different things really badly.

00:05:32.945 --> 00:05:35.014
So when I make videos, Infinite Waters,

00:05:35.014 --> 00:05:36.604
I'm just doing this.

00:05:36.604 --> 00:05:39.497
I do consultations, I just do that.

00:05:39.497 --> 00:05:42.428
I don't do a whole lot, but I have a lot

00:05:42.428 --> 00:05:45.646
of concentrated focus on one thing

00:05:45.646 --> 00:05:47.542
for a sustaining period of time,

00:05:47.542 --> 00:05:50.818
which is why we bloom and blossom, baby.

00:05:50.818 --> 00:05:52.274
But you don't want to do that, do you?

00:05:52.274 --> 00:05:54.592
You're like, "I want to
open up a gym, Ralph.

00:05:54.592 --> 00:05:56.489
"A restaurant too.

00:05:56.489 --> 00:05:58.711
"Now, I'm taking my kids for a walk,

00:05:58.711 --> 00:06:00.435
"then I'm going cycling,

00:06:00.435 --> 00:06:02.197
"then I'm going to the beach,

00:06:02.197 --> 00:06:05.416
"then I'm doing this, then I'm
doing that, then I'm doing--

00:06:05.416 --> 00:06:07.676
Oh, my goodness, gracious.

00:06:07.676 --> 00:06:10.473
You're giving yourself way too much to do.

00:06:10.473 --> 00:06:13.193
You're making it harder than it has to be.

00:06:13.193 --> 00:06:16.699
And that's why you lose the enthusiasm

00:06:16.699 --> 00:06:18.231
for what you want to do,

00:06:18.231 --> 00:06:21.469
so you don't end up
becoming productive at all.

00:06:21.469 --> 00:06:24.591
So, to become more
productive, just do one thing.

00:06:24.591 --> 00:06:28.365
And do it well, or just have fun doing it,

00:06:28.365 --> 00:06:29.553
whatever you want to do.

00:06:29.553 --> 00:06:31.553
How do we overcome fear?

00:06:32.388 --> 00:06:34.859
Any fear, doesn't matter what it is.

00:06:34.859 --> 00:06:38.442
FEAR is False Evidence Appearing Real.

00:06:38.442 --> 00:06:42.609
My definition of fear is fear
is a self-created feeling

00:06:44.307 --> 00:06:47.870
emanating from an imaginary belief

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:51.357
based on the illusion of separation.

00:06:51.357 --> 00:06:55.016
Fear is never in the present moment.

00:06:55.016 --> 00:06:59.192
Fear is either in the past or the future.

00:06:59.192 --> 00:07:02.104
Therefore, we have to tap
into the present moment

00:07:02.104 --> 00:07:05.610
to let go of fear because
the power is in the now.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:09.019
There are so many things to be afraid of

00:07:09.019 --> 00:07:11.644
in the world we're living in.

00:07:11.644 --> 00:07:13.713
But we have to remember that fear

00:07:13.713 --> 00:07:16.548
is the greatest energy vampire.

00:07:16.548 --> 00:07:21.241
The more we are in fear,
the more we lose our energy.

00:07:21.241 --> 00:07:23.483
A great way I've found to overcome fear

00:07:23.483 --> 00:07:25.839
is to face your fear.

00:07:25.839 --> 00:07:29.670
Look your fear straight in the eyes,

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:33.004
feel the fear, and do it anyway.

00:07:33.004 --> 00:07:35.264
You have to go for it.

00:07:35.264 --> 00:07:39.076
We have to embrace this
challenge fear is offering to us

00:07:39.076 --> 00:07:42.678
because fear is always
making us rise higher.

00:07:42.678 --> 00:07:43.789
You have to ask yourself,

00:07:43.789 --> 00:07:46.372
"Am I going to invest in my talent

00:07:48.061 --> 00:07:50.394
"to produce enough passion?"

00:07:51.509 --> 00:07:54.900
When I was making videos
back in the day, guess what,

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:57.486
I invested in a really good camera.

00:07:57.486 --> 00:08:00.736
I bought a Canon 5D Mark II and a lens,

00:08:02.888 --> 00:08:04.305
which cost $1000.

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:06.843
Canon 1.2

00:08:09.018 --> 00:08:11.834
Even I thought I was crazy, okay?

00:08:11.834 --> 00:08:13.309
I thought I was crazy.

00:08:13.309 --> 00:08:15.476
But deep down, I knew that

00:08:17.006 --> 00:08:19.979
I was entering the law of exchange.

00:08:19.979 --> 00:08:22.546
You've got to give something

00:08:22.546 --> 00:08:24.539
before you get something.

00:08:24.539 --> 00:08:27.374
A lot of us, we just want this lifestyle.

00:08:27.374 --> 00:08:29.615
But we don't want to put in the work.

00:08:29.615 --> 00:08:31.416
We don't want to pay our dues.

00:08:31.416 --> 00:08:32.795
we don't want to be patient.

00:08:32.795 --> 00:08:35.194
We don't want to read,
we don't want to study.

00:08:35.194 --> 00:08:37.194
Love yourself 100%.

00:08:39.159 --> 00:08:41.649
Not worrying what other people think

00:08:41.649 --> 00:08:44.963
is the greatest form of self love.

00:08:44.963 --> 00:08:47.569
When self love is absent,

00:08:47.569 --> 00:08:51.573
you will always be worrying
what other people think.

00:08:51.573 --> 00:08:54.350
People that love themselves,

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:57.517
we see them all the time in the world.

00:08:58.392 --> 00:09:02.568
And they're smiling,
they're letting go of fear,

00:09:02.568 --> 00:09:06.735
letting go, and they are
soaring to phenomenal heights.

00:09:08.258 --> 00:09:09.925
We've all gone into the streets

00:09:09.925 --> 00:09:12.013
and we've seen people singing

00:09:12.013 --> 00:09:16.419
or playing the guitar in
the middle of the road.

00:09:16.419 --> 00:09:19.252
The more your self love increases,

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:23.794
