"I feel priceless," that's
what you should be saying.

00:14:23.741 --> 00:14:26.154
But when you're really miserable,

00:14:26.154 --> 00:14:29.288
when you are really tired, depressed,

00:14:29.288 --> 00:14:31.664
someone might even give you money,

00:14:31.664 --> 00:14:35.342
but you feel like your pockets are empty.

00:14:35.342 --> 00:14:38.139
So, once you start realizing

00:14:38.139 --> 00:14:39.806
the money we attract

00:14:43.047 --> 00:14:45.630
is based, linked, and connected

00:14:46.476 --> 00:14:50.643
to the emotions we are
feeling in the present moment.

00:14:51.916 --> 00:14:55.537
As soon as I started to love myself 100%,

00:14:55.537 --> 00:14:56.704
what happened?

00:14:58.472 --> 00:15:03.437
I came to realize that I was
a walking billionaire, no.

00:15:03.437 --> 00:15:05.187
I was priceless, yes.

00:15:06.425 --> 00:15:10.425
There is no sum of money
anybody can put on you.

00:15:11.406 --> 00:15:15.601
So, start changing how
you feel about yourself

00:15:15.601 --> 00:15:20.026
to start changing what you
attract into your life.

00:15:20.026 --> 00:15:23.762
A lot of the times, we
get lazy, we get tired.

00:15:23.762 --> 00:15:27.421
But what's helped me along
my journey is to realize

00:15:27.421 --> 00:15:30.965
sometimes a TV, which
tells lies to your vision,

00:15:30.965 --> 00:15:33.455
can make you more tired and lazy.

00:15:33.455 --> 00:15:35.705
Sell your TV right now, mm,

00:15:38.045 --> 00:15:40.564
slow motion that side, mm.

00:15:40.564 --> 00:15:43.547
Actually, don't sell it, keep it.

00:15:43.547 --> 00:15:46.286
Just move to the other room. (chuckles)

00:15:46.286 --> 00:15:48.125
That's what helped me along my journey.

00:15:48.125 --> 00:15:50.079
I actually got rid of my TV.

00:15:50.079 --> 00:15:51.765
So sometimes, people come
into my house and say,

00:15:51.765 --> 00:15:55.175
"Gosh, you don't have a TV in here!"

00:15:55.175 --> 00:15:56.784
You got that right.

00:15:56.784 --> 00:15:59.044
That's why I'm creating so much, right?

00:15:59.044 --> 00:16:00.634
That's why I'm creating so much.

00:16:00.634 --> 00:16:04.801
Because the TV is great if
you use it in the right way.

00:16:05.673 --> 00:16:07.569
Sometimes, there's a
program you want to watch.

00:16:07.569 --> 00:16:11.075
But these days, a lot of the TV channels

00:16:11.075 --> 00:16:13.565
are just more programming for you,

00:16:13.565 --> 00:16:15.117
like mind control, and stuff.

00:16:15.117 --> 00:16:16.458
You can just go on the internet,

00:16:16.458 --> 00:16:18.488
watch whatever you want whenever you want,

00:16:18.488 --> 00:16:21.285
however you want, and have more fun.

00:16:21.285 --> 00:16:24.159
And also, be more productive

00:16:24.159 --> 00:16:28.159
because you see, you don't
have to just sit down

00:16:29.446 --> 00:16:32.415
and consume information on the internet.

00:16:32.415 --> 00:16:35.461
You can actually create
information, how about that?

00:16:35.461 --> 00:16:37.147
And become more productive.

00:16:37.147 --> 00:16:39.005
You can't please everyone.

00:16:39.005 --> 00:16:41.170
That's another secret.

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:44.484
Many of us, we say, "Please like me.

00:16:44.484 --> 00:16:47.013
"Please love me," to everyone.

00:16:47.013 --> 00:16:49.263
We have to remind ourselves

00:16:50.116 --> 00:16:53.469
we are not in this world to live up

00:16:53.469 --> 00:16:56.859
to other people's expectations.

00:16:56.859 --> 00:17:00.173
We are in this world to be ourselves.

00:17:00.173 --> 00:17:04.256
In essence, tune into
our authenticity 100%.

00:17:06.936 --> 00:17:09.924
Some people love you one day,

00:17:09.924 --> 00:17:11.227
then they hate you the next day.

00:17:11.227 --> 00:17:13.310
Then they love you again.

00:17:15.192 --> 00:17:18.449
What matters most to you,
how do you see yourself?

00:17:18.449 --> 00:17:19.949
That is essential.

00:17:21.955 --> 00:17:25.939
Because people's opinions
of you are always changing.

00:17:25.939 --> 00:17:30.106
However, how you see yourself
stays with you forever.

00:17:31.418 --> 00:17:34.943
The perception we have
ourselves is greater

00:17:34.943 --> 00:17:38.663
than the perception
other people have of us.

